; Probe of the caret arc: `^a.b` reads as `(^ (. a b))` (AGENTS.md:115). The
; dot arm runs first; the caret wraps the path form.
;
; Return collect copies an atom target only, so this mark takes the mark-drop
; rule: `dl8 expand` gives (: Pick (* (: a type) (: (. a b) type))).

(: Pick (* (: a type) (: ^a.b type)))
